<!-- WHAT IT ACTUALLY IS -->
<section class="py-12 lg:py-16" aria-label="What Agency OS is">
  <div class="s-line mb-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-10"></div>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-10">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-start">

      <div class="lg:col-span-5 reveal">
        <p class="text-muted text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">The Honest Version</p>
        <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-primary leading-tight mb-3 text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl">
          A team of specialists.<br />Not one model guessing.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-secondary text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-3">
          "AI-built" usually means one model improvising an entire project in one pass — no review, no specialization, no way to catch a bad decision before it ships. That's the vibe-coded look, and it shows.
        </p>
        <p class="text-secondary text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Agency OS instead breaks a project into roles a real studio would have — product, design, architecture, engineering, QA — and routes work through each of them, with review built into the handoffs.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-7 reveal rd2">
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3.5">
          <div class="glass rounded-xl p-4 border border-accent/15">
            <p class="text-primary text-sm font-semibold mb-1">Orchestrator</p>
            <p class="text-secondary text-xs leading-relaxed">Breaks the objective into workstreams, assigns the right specialist, and never blindly trusts a single output.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="glass rounded-xl p-4 border border-accent/15">
            <p class="text-primary text-sm font-semibold mb-1">Specialist Agents</p>
            <p class="text-secondary text-xs leading-relaxed">Product, design, architecture, engineering, QA and more — each with a defined mission and its own quality bar.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="glass rounded-xl p-4 border border-accent/15">
            <p class="text-primary text-sm font-semibold mb-1">Quality Gates</p>
            <p class="text-secondary text-xs leading-relaxed">Work doesn't advance to the next stage until it clears a defined gate — requirements, design, architecture, QA.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="glass rounded-xl p-4 border border-accent/15">
            <p class="text-primary text-sm font-semibold mb-1">Human Approval</p>
            <p class="text-secondary text-xs leading-relaxed">The founder signs off at every key gate. The system proposes; a person decides.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

